{"ref":"BDB, מְצוּדָה","hw":"מְצוּדָה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּדָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. net, prey</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.21\">Ez 13:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:11\" href=\"/Psalms.66.11\">ψ 66:11</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּדָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.13\">Ez 12:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.20\">17:20</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>net</em>, in fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s judgment, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.13\">Ez 12:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.20\">17:20</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶשֶׁת</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:11\" href=\"/Psalms.66.11\">ψ 66:11</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>prey</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.21\">Ez 13:21</a> (fig.).","next":"BDB, מְצוֹדָה²","prev":"BDB, מְצוֹדָה"}